THIRD-PARTY ASSETS

This repository bundles font files that are licensed separately. The fonts are
distributed in more than one place, and EVERY copy carries the full license
text alongside it:

  Spoqa Han Sans Neo (Thin/Light/Regular/Medium/Bold)
    SIL Open Font License 1.1
    styles/foundation/fonts/LICENSE-SpoqaHanSansNeo.txt   (locked foundation mirror)
    dist/crefle-doc/fonts/LICENSE-SpoqaHanSansNeo.txt     (vendorable bundle)

  Material Symbols Rounded
    Apache License 2.0
    styles/foundation/fonts/LICENSE-MaterialSymbols.txt   (locked foundation mirror)
    dist/crefle-doc/fonts/LICENSE-MaterialSymbols.txt     (vendorable bundle)

  JetBrains Mono (Regular/Bold)
    SIL Open Font License 1.1
    styles/fonts/LICENSE-JetBrainsMono.txt                (doc-domain source)
    dist/crefle-doc/fonts/LICENSE-JetBrainsMono.txt       (vendorable bundle)

The "All rights reserved" statement above does not apply to these fonts.

`scripts/check-licenses.mjs` enforces this: it fails the build if any directory
containing a font binary lacks its license text. A document built with
`build --inline` embeds the fonts as base64 data: URIs — which is also
redistribution — so the build injects the same license texts into the generated
HTML as a comment block.

Do not remove a LICENSE-*.txt without removing the font binaries beside it.
A font copy without its license is unauthorised redistribution.

